<title>POLAND: ROLIMPEX AUG NET FALLS TO PLN 1.3 MLN.</title>
<headline>ROLIMPEX AUG NET FALLS TO PLN 1.3 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-09-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results August</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>AUGUST</p>
<p> Net profit	     1.30 vs   3.17</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 2.33 vs   5.28</p>
<p> Operating profit     4.67 vs   7.24</p>
<p> Sales		   86.10 vs 131.33</p>
<p>JANUARY-AUGUST</p>
<p> Net profit	    19.98 vs  28.67</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	30.27 vs  46.49</p>
<p> Operating profit    51.10 vs  52.30</p>
<p> Sales		  814.61 vs 689.38</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish food trader is Rolimpex SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
